OL,3,AUS says it will issue visa to Flavio
OL,4,ABolsonaro as Brazilian authorities
OL,5,Aquestion his whereabouts
OL,6,
OL,7,FBolsonaro, who was defeated in the
OL,8,FBrazilian presidential election on
OL,9,FSunday, is under investigation for
OL,10,Falleged corruption and money
OL,11,Flaundering, which he denies
OL,13,FOn Monday, the Supreme Court gave him
OL,14,F24 hours to hand over his passports
OL,16,FA lawyer for Bolsonaro tells BBC Brasil
OL,17,Fthat she is "completely in the dark"
OL,18,Fand has no information about the
OL,19,Fsituation
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
